# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID NA06991 (CEPH/Utah Pedigree 1341).
# GeT-RM consensus diplotype: *15/*15 -- homozygous for the combined
# rs2306283+rs4149056 haplotype, unambiguous (both haplotypes trivially
# carry both variants, no dosage inference needed). Note: this same
