# project (tests/fixtures/getrm/dpyd/NA06991.vcf) -- the same cell line,
# characterized independently for a different gene; no conflict. Source:
# Pratt VM et al. 2016, J Mol Diagn 18:109-123 (PMID 26621101), as
# reproduced in Coriell's "GeT-RM PGx Search" tool
# (https://www.coriell.org/GeTRM/PGxSearch, retrieved 2026-08-18). Genotype
# below constructed from this project's own dbSNP-confirmed defining-variant
# coordinates (genes/slco1b1.py), not redistributed from GeT-RM/Coriell/CDC
# directly.
